# safe_security — BoundaryViolationError: a SAFE action may not call
# FAST, SMART or PERSISTENT actions — every forbidden pair is blocked
# at the callee entry and logged as a BOUNDARY event. Only SAFE→SAFE
# (and SAFE→BALANCED) pass; the blocked bodies never print (v0.48.16).
ACTION fast_action() WITH MISSION FAST, SHOW "FAST RAN". /ACTION.
ACTION smart_action() WITH MISSION SMART, SHOW "SMART RAN". /ACTION.
ACTION persist_action() WITH MISSION PERSISTENT, SHOW "PERSISTENT RAN". /ACTION.
ACTION safe_action() WITH MISSION SAFE, SHOW "SAFE RAN". /ACTION.

ACTION main() WITH MISSION SAFE,
  CALL fast_action().
  CALL smart_action().
  CALL persist_action().
  CALL safe_action().
  SHOW "done".
  SHOW ffi_audit_dump().
/ACTION.
